/T (The Theatre AHU's layout was reconfigured to fix a long-standing inefficiency: the run-around coil sat downstream of the pre-heater, undermining energy recovery. Works included a new pre-filter bulkhead and relocating the run-around coil and filtration into the correct sequence.)
/E (The Theatre AHU's layout was reconfigured to fix a long-standing inefficiency: the run-around coil sat downstream of the pre-heater, undermining energy recovery. Works included a new pre-filter bulkhead and relocating the run-around coil and filtration into the correct sequence.)
