/T (The redundant gas pipework and burner assemblies in both AHUs were safely decommissioned and purged from gas to air in line with IGE/UP/1A, removing an obsolete heating source no longer fit for purpose. This included isolating and removing all associated valves, controls and gas train components, clearing the way for the new refrigeration-based heating system that replaced it.)
/E (The redundant gas pipework and burner assemblies in both AHUs were safely decommissioned and purged from gas to air in line with IGE/UP/1A, removing an obsolete heating source no longer fit for purpose. This included isolating and removing all associated valves, controls and gas train components, clearing the way for the new refrigeration-based heating system that replaced it.)
